Building data from WUDAPT LCZ.  
For this option the 11 LCZ categories are added to NLCD40 to make NLCD51
To do this you need to run geogrid twice for NLCD40 and MODIS_lcz61
Then use R script (nlcd_lcz.R) written by Rob Gilliam to merge the two LU datasets into NLCD51.
The script (update.lcz.csh) can do all 3 operations
Note that the LCZ data in NLCD51 (cats 41-51) are independent of the NLCD40 data.
